    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"WipedMemory","source":"You're the new farmer, aren't you?#$e#You seem... no. I'm sure we've never met.","translation":"你就是新來的農夫，對吧？#$e#你看起來……不。我確定我們從沒見過。"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"DefaultHorseName","source":"Grover","translation":"格羅弗"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"JunimoTextAboveHead1","source":"Junimo!","translation":"祝尼魔！"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"JunimoTextAboveHead2","source":"Star!","translation":"星星！"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"JunimoThankYou1","source":"Thank you!","translation":"謝謝你！"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"JunimoThankYou2","source":"A gift!","translation":"禮物！"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"AbigailInMineFlute","source":"%Abigail is lost in her music...","translation":"%Abigail沉醉在自己的音樂中……"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"AbigailInMineFirst","source":"Hey, @. Surprised? ...I finally found the courage to come down here.#$b#I felt scared at first, but I pushed through.#$b#I feel much more confident now. This is actually really fun!$h","translation":"嘿，@。很意外嗎？……我終於鼓起勇氣來到這裡。#$b#起初很害怕，但還是撐過來了。#$b#現在有自信多了。這其實真的很好玩！$h"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"AbigailInMine0","source":"Hey! I made it pretty far, didn't I?$h","translation":"嘿！我走得很深了，對吧？$h"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"AbigailInMine1","source":"Eep!$7#$b#Hahah! You scared me! I didn't expect to see another person down here!$h#$e#Sorry, I'm all sweaty from excitement...","translation":"呀！$7#$b#哈哈！你嚇到我了！沒想到會在這裡見到別人！$h#$e#抱歉，興奮得滿身是汗……"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"AbigailInMine2","source":"Hi @! I made it here without fighting any monsters... ","translation":"嗨，@！我一路來到這裡，沒有和任何怪物戰鬥……"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"AbigailInMine3","source":"Hey! It's a relief to see you down here...$h#$e#Um... don't tell my Dad I'm here, okay?$9","translation":"嘿！在這裡看到你，真讓人安心……$h#$e#嗯……別告訴爸爸我在這裡，好嗎？$9"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"AbigailInMine4","source":"Hey! Exploring the mines on a rainy day, huh? Me too!$h","translation":"嘿！下雨天來探索礦井，對吧？我也是！$h"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"Henchman1","source":"Gweee-ah!! Human!#$b#...You want to pass? I'm sorry, this is private property.$s","translation":"咿呀！！人類！#$b#……你想通過？抱歉，這裡是私人土地。$s"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"Henchman2","source":"I'm sorry, but I can't let you pass... I'd lose my job.","translation":"抱歉，但我不能讓你通過……不然會丟掉工作。"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"Henchman3","source":"You're offering this to me? Hmm... no thanks.$s","translation":"你要把這個給我？嗯……不用了，謝謝。$s"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"Henchman4","source":"Mmmm... that looks fresh, but no thanks... why don't you have it?","translation":"嗯……看起來很新鮮，但不用了，謝謝……你自己吃吧？"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"Henchman5","source":"*sniff*...*sniff*...#$b#That smell...#$b#I can't resist... Gimme that!$h","translation":"*嗅嗅*……*嗅嗅*……#$b#那股氣味……#$b#我無法抗拒……把它給我！$h"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"Henchman6","source":"Thanks.","translation":"謝啦。"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"KrobusDarkTalisman","source":"What's that... you're looking for a dark talisman?#$b#...Hmmm. Now that you mention it, I did have one in my possession not too long ago.#$b#Unfortunately, I dropped it while exploring that tunnel in the far corner.#$b#Things started heating up in there, so I left in a hurry and sealed the entrance.#$b#You seem pretty sturdy, though... So I'll open it back up for you. Just be careful, okay?","translation":"怎麼了……你在找黑暗護符？#$b#……嗯。聽你這麼一說，不久前我確實有一枚。#$b#可惜探索遠處角落的那條隧道時，我把它弄丟了。#$b#那裡開始變得很熱，所以我匆忙離開，封住了入口。#$b#不過你看起來相當強健……所以我會替你重新打開。務必小心，好嗎？"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"Divorced_bouquet","source":"This... Are you trying to hurt me even more?$s","translation":"這個……你想讓我受更多傷嗎？$s"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"Divorced_gift","source":"I don't want your gift.$a","translation":"我不要你的禮物。$a"},
    {"target":"Strings/Characters","key":"PetLovesYou","source":"{0} loves you. <","translation":"{0}愛你。<"},
